WEBVTT

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.910
Wh-What is this light?!

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.630
All the Heart Seeds we've gathered are glowing!

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.270
So that must mean...

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.590
Something amazing is going to happen!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:17.990
{OP}

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.180
HeartCatch

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.640
Precure!

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:26.190
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:29.190
Now, all together

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.660
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.280
Within each of our chests,

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.620
The seeds of the heart

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:47.870
are growing

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.500
bit by bit

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:51.170
Red,

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:51.790
white

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.090
and yellow

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.300
all varied colors

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:58.760
that they

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:00.930
shine so brightly!

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:06.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.770
with such care

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.480
will never wither

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.950
Now, all together

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:20.410
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.080
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:27.960
They're always right by our sides

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:28.790
So together

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.630
bloom even more!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.130
HeartCatch

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.630
Precure!

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:53.870
Professor Sabark, King Dune
 has gotten in contact with us.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:54.860
What? {Can we extend this line a bit? It's really short.}

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.280
His patience has finally run out, then...

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.490
King Dune, how may I help you?

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.700
Sa...rk?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.280
Is that... Sabark?

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.030
Yes, sir. {Again, can we extend this a little?}

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.300
It seems we have a pretty poor signal.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.960
Worry not, I can hear your voice.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:12.840
Though I loathe to be blunt,

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:17.170
what progress has been made with the desertification of Earth and humanity?

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.300
Well, on that front, due to the appearance of new Precure...

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:23.010
we have fallen surprisingly behind schedule.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:24.370
Sabark!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.230
Did you think I was going to strip you of your command?

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.860
Please don't joke, Your Highness.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:41.480
As the fairies who protect the Great Heart Tree managed to escape, it was an inevitable turn of events.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.570
I'm not blaming you.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:50.110
I actually have some useful information for you.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:54.700
The reason that I, Dune, was defeated by Cure Flower

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.590
may indeed have been partially due to her own strength.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.700
However, I am certain that she managed to 
obtain something which fortified her powers.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.760
I believe that was the major factor in my downfall.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.700
What was it she obtained, then?

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.490
If I knew, it would not have caused such problems.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:13.100
Regardless, we must obtain it, no matter the cost.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:18.230
If we can destroy it or make it our own, we have little to fear from the Precure.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.880
I am certain there must be a lead at the Great Heart Tree.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.200
So I ask you to investigate for me.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.320
Of course, sir.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:33.710
The Third Fairy<i>!</i>

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:33.710
The Third Fairy<i>!</i>

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:38.540
Y-Y-You want me to be a model?!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.630
What's going on, Momo?

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:48.920
Well, the thing is, the model who always plays the role of my little sister when I do shoots for this magazine

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.100
had to pull out suddenly,

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.920
and if we don't do the shoot tomorrow, 
we won't make it in time for publication.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.350
So please fill in for her!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.150
B-But, there's no way I'd...

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:01.860
Hey, wait! If you want someone to play the little sister role, why not just ask, you know, your <i>actual</i> little sister!

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:05.360
If I was going to ask you, I 
would've done so from the start.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.700
But Tsubomi's physique is pretty much exactly the same as that model's.

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.070
Well, if that's the reason, then fine...

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:15.950
Come on, Tsubomi. I'll tag along, so just help her out, okay?

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.640
I-I can't do it! There's no way I could model...

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:21.140
Tsubomi, didn't you say you wanted to change yourself?!

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.920
This'd be a really good chance!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.260
B-B-But...

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.450
Okay, it's settled! A round of applause, everyone!

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.280
Huh? You want me to get inshide?

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:54.780
The Great Heart Tree...

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.170
Seek it out, Dark Precure.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:02.460
If King Dune learns of this, we shall not get off lightly.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.850
Fear not, Professor Sabark.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:07.130
The Great Heart Tree is still nearby.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.690
You mushtn't hurt the Great Heart Tree!

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:35.610
I didn't expect another fairy...

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.260
Tsubomi! You're really stiff.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.730
Can't you try and loosen up a little?

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:53.430
I-It's not something I can do just because you ask me to.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:54.770
Tsubomi!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.250
That's nice!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.440
This looks great.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.500
Tsubomi, give us a smile! A smile!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.360
Tsubomi, once we've finished shooting, let's go to a sweets buffet, okay? {lit: Engrish term "sweets viking". Because, you know. We can't call an all-you-can-eat buffet a buffet. That'd make too much sense. We have to call them VIKINGS.}

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.630
Huh? Really?!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.390
Nice!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.480
That's what we're after, Tsubomi!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.740
Right, okay!

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:18.790
Let's go to the next set!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.020
Karin!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.030
Karin, please wait!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.100
Momo?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.770
Karin? Is she...

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.490
Yeah.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.600
I was supposed to model with her today.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:55.320
I did not imagine the Great Heart 
Tree would give rise to a new fairy.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.950
Could that fairy be the lead that King Dune was referring to?

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.410
Perhaps. Capture it.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.650
Shtop it! I can't shtop their attacks anymore!

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:21.810
Huh? "Run while you shtill can?"

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:25.700
If you shay sho!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.000
It vanished...

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:43.460
Wait.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.800
It most likely fled to join the other fairies. {fleed -> fled}

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.740
Let's leave Sasorina and the others to hunt them down.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.760
For now, focus on finding the Great Heart Tree.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.680
Where is Sasorina?

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.540
She went to torment the Precure.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.460
Acting on her own again...

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.320
Well, it matters not. A third fairy has appeared.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.200
What did you say?!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:18.600
I imagine it will attempt to rendezvous with the other fairies and the Precure.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:22.660
So I entrust you two with capturing it and bringing it back to me alive.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:23.660
Yes, sir.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.290
That crying sounds like...

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:36.970
Could it be...

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.360
What's the matter?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.430
We'll be back soon, okay?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.690
<i>What's with her? What's with her?!</i>

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:06.080
<i>Just going ahead and replacing me like that!</i>

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.830
<i>Kurumi Momoka's been planning this from the start!</i>

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.560
<i>What's with this "charismatic model" crap?!</i>

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.080
Stop, stop!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:21.600
Huh?

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:26.550
Karin, we're trying to get a natural-looking scene of two sisters just out having fun.

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:28.180
Can you stop staring right at the camera?

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:32.360
Huh? But 45 degrees to the right helps capture my best side.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.180
Can't we change the positioning around?

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.570
You really need to start listening to what you're told, Karin.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.150
Momoka's meant to be the star of this shoot, after all.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:47.040
Sorry, but I'm feeling a little tired. Do you mind if we take a break?

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.940
S-Sure...

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.000
Karin, come with me.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:53.270
Take a seat, Karin.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:59.040
I've been meaning to tell you this for a while, but you really do try to draw too much attention to yourself.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.320
Huh? Really?

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:05.380
What's important for us models is to attempt to convey the intent of the designers

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:09.720
and to place ourselves in the mindset of the readers who'll want the clothes we model.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:13.610
Karin?

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:18.570
Your father's a really famous photographer, 
and your mother's a former charismatic model!

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:24.070
Someone like you who's only famous because of her parents would never understand how I feel! {cause -> because}

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.480
I'm going home!

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:27.540
Karin!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:34.230
I see. So that's why Karin pulled out... {It's because she didn't want to get Momo pregnant.}

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:37.670
She's totally wrong! You didn't get where 
you were because of who your parents are!

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:40.920
You were scouted in the first place,

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:45.410
and it's because you've worked so hard that you've gotten to where you are now, right, Momo?

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:46.680
Thank you, Erika.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:50.680
I just thought that she had real potential,

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.970
so I wanted to give her some advice to help her along.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.270
It's not just me.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.670
The staff want Karin to come back too.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.740
Why was she so damn condescending?

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:22.520
Now, whose Flower of the Heart shall I steal for my Desertrian today?

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.120
I've found a sad little girl!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.680
Whoa! A weirdo!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.300
You sure are rude, calling me a weirdo.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.610
The Flower of your Heart is wilting pretty nicely.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.590
Flower of the Heart, come forth!

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:51.950
It's Sasorina!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:56.280
Now then, what kind of Desertrian should I make today?

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.130
This'll be perfect...

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.110
It's your cue, Desertrian!

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:06.930
Mannequin!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.940
Desertrian, run wild and lure those Precure out!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.480
Mannequin!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.980
I won't forgive you, Kurumi Momoka!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.400
Wait, what?!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.600
Hey, where do you think you're going?!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:26.660
Come back here this instant!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:29.120
We have to let Erika and Tsubomi know! {ERIKA-TACHI}

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.000
Wh-What the heck is that?!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.960
P-Please halt!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.750
Out of my way!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.250
Mannequin!

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.090
We've got trouble!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.300
There's this giant monster heading straight toward us!

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:50.770
Erika?!

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.100
Just come over here for a sec, okay?

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:55.600
That's...

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:02.070
Karin's Flower of the Heart is the one that was stolen by Sasorina!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.820
Tsubomi, let's go!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:04.570
Right!

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:18.250
Go forth, Seeds of the Precure!

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.570
Precure!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.210
Open My Heart!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:11.890
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.140
Cure Blossom!

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:22.610
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.200
Cure Marine!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.490
So there you are, Momoka!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.960
You can't run from me!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.180
Get away from here, quickly!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.640
So you finally decided to show up, Precures!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.520
Desertrian, get them!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.070
Get out of my way! {+of}

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.690
We won't!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:14.030
Momo... I mean, Kurumi Momoka hasn't gotten this far as a model just because of who her parents were!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:19.240
Momoka has earned her place as a 
charismatic model with her own hands! {and her tits}

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:20.830
Shut up!

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.910
How can you be so dense?!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.640
Momoka thinks really highly of you, Karin!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.750
What do you think you're doing?! {playing at -> doing}

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.190
Get up off your butt up already!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:51.320
Let's defeat it while we have the chance and get the Flower of her Heart back!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:51.820
All right!

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:59.370
Kumojacky? Kobraja? What are you guys doing here?!

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:01.040
Pure coincidence, I'm afraid.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.660
We've been hunting for the new fairy.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:07.830
But we saw you fighting, so we 
thought we'd come lend you a hand.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.090
Desertrian!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.050
Mannequin!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:15.180
All right! That's the way!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.840
Let's finish them off!

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:25.070
Big Bang Kumojacky Special!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.360
I won't let you hurt the Precuresh!

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:38.630
What?!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.860
My beautiful face, ruined!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.310
I won't forget this!

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:57.250
I've found you at lasht!

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:59.000
Wait, who are you?

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.500
You're so cute!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:06.780
Because we gathered so many Heart Seeds and restored the Great Heart Tree, a new fairy has been born from it.

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:08.740
What's your name?

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.140
My name ish Potpourri!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.980
You're so cute!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.220
Hey, stop that!

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:19.940
Why are you just ignoring us?!

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:22.740
And you! What do you think you're doing?! Get them!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:24.040
Mannequin!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.540
You're just using Karin's vulnerable, broken heart for your own ends,

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.710
and I've had it up to here with this!

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:39.470
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.610
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.800
Marine Tact!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.040
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:19.840
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:48.430
I'll let you off with this just this once!

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.170
Karin!

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:56.880
What happened?!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.380
We found her unconscious outside!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.050
Were you attacked by that monster?

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.090
Are you hurt?

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:07.190
Momoka's been worried sick about you, you know?!

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:07.760
What?

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.160
That's right!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:14.480
Momoka was totally against replacing you for today's shoot until the very last moment!

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:19.460
<i>Then what the Precures were
 saying in my dream was true...</i>

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:24.320
We all believed you'd come back eventually.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.330
Momoka...

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:31.630
I'm...

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:33.810
I'm...

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:40.970
I'm so sorry!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:45.310
I know. {Really fast line, can we extend?}

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:58.400
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:13.380
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:21.300
In the language of flowers, a browallia means "to be blessed with charisma."

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:25.860
It'd be nice if Karin could tap into her 
own unique charisma more in the future.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:29.560
Kinda sucks, though. You woulda 
gotten to debut as a model after all.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:33.220
I'm fine with just being a Precure, I think.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:38.140
But I really need to thank you, Potpourri, for protecting us back there.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:41.010
Potpourri has very strong protective powers, it seems.

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:42.480
That so?

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.450
What're you shouting for?!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:49.160
If Potpourri, a third fairy, has been born...

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:52.620
...then that must mean that there's a third Precure too, right?!

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:54.580
That'sh right!

